==================================================
Heron Tools - shared window theme (Heron brand, dark)
Used by every Heron Tools window. Brush KEY names are what windows bind to; values come
only from the Heron brand palette:

    Ink #0F0F10      dark background, text on light
    Mist #F7F5F2     text on dark (as see-through shades), light background
    Accent #FD641A   the one highlight colour: main button, selection, focus - never "danger"
    Accent Light #FF9A5C  only as the light end of an Accent gradient, never alone
    Surface #1B1B1F  a panel or card on the dark background
    Success #3ECF8E  done, passed      Warning #F5A524  needs attention
    Error #FF5A4E    failed, refused   White #FFFFFF    text on Accent
    Shadow #000000   only as a see-through shadow

Shades are see-through versions of these, never new colours: Mist over Ink at 92 % main text,
72 % secondary, 55 % quiet, 14 % a line, 8 % / 4 % a faint fill.
Never add a colour here that is not in that list - ask first.

Font: Manrope, falling back to Segoe UI when Manrope is not installed on the PC.

Templates and motion were carried over from the AJ-Tools theme (Filter Pro move, 2026-11-07); only
the colours and font changed. A few keys (DataGrid, Success/Danger buttons, brush aliases) are not used
by today's windows; they are kept for the next tools moved in, and use brand colours only.
==================================================
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- Brand font, with the Windows system font as the fallback. -->
    <FontFamily x:Key="BrandFont">Manrope, Segoe UI</FontFamily>

